    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini Painter</strong> is a cozy idle desktop game about finding the balance between work and rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a meditative world where a tiny painter colors tiny figurines, decorates their home, and learns to take care of themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/b56505b151c36387b68e36d476c62e19.poster.avif?t=1754000442\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/b56505b151c36387b68e36d476c62e19.webm?t=1754000442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Decorate the room, buy new geeky items, and boost your little painter\u2019s creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more creativity they have, the better their miniatures will turn out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each painted miniature brings you closer to your ultimate goal: a long-awaited vacation... Or maybe skip the vacation and just keep painting?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/4edb395925686f9754687d9b86dab1db.poster.avif?t=1754000442\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/4edb395925686f9754687d9b86dab1db.webm?t=1754000442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unhurried progress:</strong> take your time creating the perfect geeky room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work and rest balance:</strong> don't overwork your artist, or he'll burn out. But don't let him relax too much either, or he'll lose his motivation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/91a685766b178241c965bb61b431659d.poster.avif?t=1754000442\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/91a685766b178241c965bb61b431659d.webm?t=1754000442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 unique miniatures</strong>: Unlock packs of figures, each one a direct nod to a famous character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill growth</strong>: The more experienced your character becomes, the faster they work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art in isometric view</strong>: That warm 2000s vibe, right on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Around 70 hours of meditative gameplay.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini Painter</strong> is a cozy idle desktop game about finding the balance between work and rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a meditative world where a tiny painter colors tiny figurines, decorates their home, and learns to take care of themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/b56505b151c36387b68e36d476c62e19.poster.avif?t=1754000442\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/b56505b151c36387b68e36d476c62e19.webm?t=1754000442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Decorate the room, buy new geeky items, and boost your little painter\u2019s creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more creativity they have, the better their miniatures will turn out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each painted miniature brings you closer to your ultimate goal: a long-awaited vacation... Or maybe skip the vacation and just keep painting?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/4edb395925686f9754687d9b86dab1db.poster.avif?t=1754000442\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/4edb395925686f9754687d9b86dab1db.webm?t=1754000442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unhurried progress:</strong> take your time creating the perfect geeky room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work and rest balance:</strong> don't overwork your artist, or he'll burn out. But don't let him relax too much either, or he'll lose his motivation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/91a685766b178241c965bb61b431659d.poster.avif?t=1754000442\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694840/extras/91a685766b178241c965bb61b431659d.webm?t=1754000442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 unique miniatures</strong>: Unlock packs of figures, each one a direct nod to a famous character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill growth</strong>: The more experienced your character becomes, the faster they work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art in isometric view</strong>: That warm 2000s vibe, right on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Around 70 hours of meditative gameplay.</strong></p></li></ul>",
